('ST_079', 'Ygii', 'Ygii is a Saudi-born gifting and consumer-intent platform that helps individuals and businesses make gifting more thoughtful, personal, and data-driven. For consumers, Ygii allows people to create and share wishlists, making it easier for friends and family to give gifts that are truly wanted. For businesses, Ygii provides corporate gifting solutions that help companies manage employee, client, and partner gifting with better personalization, cultural relevance, branding, fulfillment, and measurable impact. What makes Ygii different is that every wishlist also represents a clear signal of future consumer demand. By capturing what people genuinely want before they buy, Ygii is building a valuable layer of zero-party consumer intent data. This positions the company beyond gifting alone, at the intersection of consumer behavior, corporate engagement, and demand intelligence. Ygii’s vision is to transform gifting from a manual and often generic process into a smarter relationship-building experience powered by technology, cultural understanding, and real human preference. The platform currently serves both B2C and B2B use cases, with future potential across corporate gifting, social commerce, retail insights, CSR gifting, and demand forecasting.', 'Technology', null, null, 'Seed', 'Riyadh', 'Social Commerce ,Marketplace', 'https://www.ygii.app/', 'https://ecosystemsa.com/modules/startups/c87e4ba9-66e2-4205-b7b1-c0773c29254e', 'https://ecosystemsa.com/modules/startups/c87e4ba9-66e2-4205-b7b1-c0773c29254e', null),
