('ST_147', 'Abwab.ai', 'Abwab.ai is an award-winning Saudi AI company transforming how financial institutions underwrite, assess, and scale SME credit across the Kingdom. Founded to redefine SME lending in Saudi Arabia, Abwab was built by a team of fintech and AI experts who recognized a critical gap between innovation and accessibility in financial decision-making. While consumer finance rapidly evolved, SME credit across the region remained manual, fragmented, and opaque. Our mission is clear: to bridge the $250B SME financing gap across MENA by turning complex financial data into clear, explainable credit intelligence. Through real-time data, deep credit insights, and regulator-ready reporting, we enable lenders to make faster, smarter, and more cost-efficient decisions. To date, Abwab has already enabled the processing of over SAR 1 billion in SME loans, reflecting the growing trust in data-driven underwriting across the ecosystem. Today, Abwab partners with banks, NBFIs, fintechs, funds, and regulators to build the infrastructure for modern SME lending; driving scalable underwriting, data-driven risk management, and faster credit deployment across the Kingdom and beyond.', 'Financial Services & Fintech', 'B2B', null, 'Series A', 'Riyadh', 'Fintech Infrastructure,SME-Funding', 'https://abwab.ai', 'https://ecosystemsa.com/modules/startups/b7013ea2-8e1e-44c5-bb16-0e9f58a19cf2', 'https://ecosystemsa.com/modules/startups/b7013ea2-8e1e-44c5-bb16-0e9f58a19cf2', null),
