('ST_219', 'Popsy', 'Popsy is a fast-growing Saudi Arabia–based marketplace for refurbished electronics, focused on making high-quality devices more affordable, accessible, and sustainable. The platform specializes in premium refurbished smartphones and consumer electronics, with a strong emphasis on quality assurance, transparency, and customer trust. Every device sold on Popsy undergoes rigorous inspection and is backed by warranty coverage (typically ranging from 1 to 3 years), along with a 14-day return policy to ensure customer confidence. Popsy is building a full-stack commerce and payments ecosystem tailored to the kingdom, enabling flexible purchasing options including installment plans and financing solutions to increase affordability and conversion. By integrating logistics, payments, and after-sales support, Popsy simplifies the buying experience while extending the lifecycle of electronic devices. The company’s mission is to make refurbished electronics the default choice in the region by combining affordability, reliability, and a seamless digital experience, while contributing to a more circular and sustainable tech economy.', 'Consumer Services; Technology; Retail & E-commerce', null, null, 'Pre-Series A', 'Riyadh', 'Marketplace,Consumer Services', 'https://www.popsy.sa/', 'https://ecosystemsa.com/modules/startups/7797b657-ccf4-4e2f-93b5-461492966525', 'https://ecosystemsa.com/modules/startups/7797b657-ccf4-4e2f-93b5-461492966525', null),
