('ST_350', 'MENA Cashback', 'MENA Cashback is a digital rewards platform that enables users across the Middle East and North Africa to earn cashback, discounts, and exclusive deals when shopping online. The platform partners with over 2,000 regional and global brands, allowing users to shop through its website, mobile apps, or browser extensions and earn rewards on everyday purchases. Users can then withdraw their cashback via bank transfer, PayPal, gift cards, or donate to charities, and soon introducing a cryptocurrency cashout option, making it both a savings and impact-driven platform. In addition to its consumer offering, MENA Cashback provides a powerful B2B white-label solution, enabling large platforms and apps to integrate cashback and rewards into their ecosystems via API. This creates new revenue streams for partners while increasing user engagement and retention. With live products, growing user traction, and strong regional partnerships, MENA Cashback is positioned to become a leading rewards and affiliate commerce platform in the MENA region.', 'Financial Services & Fintech', null, null, 'Seed', 'Riyadh', 'Affiliate Marketing, E-Commerce, Financial Solution, Loyalty, Rewards', 'https://www.menacashback.com', 'https://ecosystemsa.com/modules/startups/cd2acffb-7790-409a-b09d-9e2714a488b6', 'https://ecosystemsa.com/modules/startups/cd2acffb-7790-409a-b09d-9e2714a488b6', null),
