('ST_374', 'Rology', 'Rology is the Middle East and Africa''s leading AI-assisted teleradiology company and operates the FDA 510(k)-cleared Rology Teleradiology Platform. Founded in 2017, Rology helps hospitals, imaging centers and public health systems overcome radiologist shortages and reporting delays through secure, on-demand access to a network of more than 300 expert radiologists. The platform supports rapid, subspecialized reporting across 8 imaging modalities and 12 subspecialties, with embedded AI tools, intelligent case routing, quality-assurance workflows and 24/7 operations. Rology has delivered more than 1.6 million radiology reports to over 400 hospitals across 13 countries and has regional offices in Saudi Arabia, Egypt and Kenya. Rology partners with healthcare providers, government entities, technology integrators, cloud and AI companies, and medical-imaging organizations to expand reliable radiology access across Saudi Arabia, the Middle East and Africa.', 'Health & Life Sciences; Technology', 'B2B; B2G; B2B2C', 'Rology Teleradiology Platform; Rology Embedded AI Tools; 24/7 On-Demand Teleradiology Reporting; Emergency and Priority Reporting; Subspecialty Reporting and Second Opinions', 'Pre-Series A', 'Riyadh', 'AI & Machine Learning,Telehealth', 'https://rology.health', 'https://ecosystemsa.com/modules/startups/3a2d8b6c-fe4a-451a-9815-0388c9a0675f', 'https://rology.health', 'Saudi Arabia'),
