('ST_643', 'Glorda', 'Glorda is a Saudi gift platform and events that collects the best rose shops, cakes, desserts and gifts in a single application, with a quick and high procurement experiment based on the client &apos; s location. A Saudi gifting marketplace for flowers, cakes, sweets, and occasion products, conne cting cu stom ers with nearby local stores through a fast and elegant experience.', 'Retail & E-commerce', null, null, 'Seed', 'Makkah', 'Gifting, Marketplace', 'https://glorda.com/', 'https://ecosystemsa.com/modules/startups/9fd9855c-3bc5-4b16-8f7b-089f08056e7a', 'https://ecosystemsa.com/modules/startups/9fd9855c-3bc5-4b16-8f7b-089f08056e7a', null),
