Estajer is Saudi Arabia''s leading rental marketplace, connecting businesses and individuals with verified suppliers across events, hospitality, and beyond.', 'Retail & E-commerce', 'B2B; B2C', null, 'Pre-Seed', 'Riyadh', 'Marketplace', 'https://estajer.com/', 'https://ecosystemsa.com/modules/startups/a423c4ea-4e3a-40da-9ed4-79509175b6d3', 'https://ecosystemsa.com/modules/startups/a423c4ea-4e3a-40da-9ed4-79509175b6d3', 'Saudi Arabia'),
('ST_645', 'QawelTech', 'Qawel Tech is an AI-powered procurement platform transforming how construction projects source, evaluate, and execute purchasing decisions.
The platform analyzes project documents (RFPs/contracts), breaks them into structured procurement packages, and delivers executive recommendations within days instead of months—reducing time loss across sourcing, comparison, negotiation, and contracting.
Targeting mid-to-large construction projects (SAR 50M–100M), where 60–70% of costs are tied to procurement, Qawel Tech enables developers and contractors to make faster, data-driven decisions with higher efficiency and cost optimization.
Beyond procurement, the platform integrates suppliers, logistics, financial solutions, and expert inputs into one unified decision layer—creating a new standard for how construction procurement is managed.
Qawel Tech is not just digitizing procurement; it is rebuilding how procurement decisions are made.', 'Real Estate; Construction & Infrastructure; Transportation & Logistics', null, null, 'Pre-Series A', 'Riyadh', 'Construction Tech, AI, B2B Marketplace, Smart Procurement', 'https://www.qaweltech.com', 'https://ecosystemsa.com/modules/startups/e4297b5f-c492-40f6-a5c8-774383eccf53', 'https://ecosystemsa.com/modules/startups/e4297b5f-c492-40f6-a5c8-774383eccf53', null),
