('ST_647', 'QissaTech', 'It is an innovative technical platform aimed at creating a qualitative shift in technical employment in the Kingdom of Saudi Arabia, which brings together Saudi companies wishing to attract specialized technical competencies with Arab technical talents with medium- and high-level job seekers, with the addition of supporting emerging companies to strengthen their work and expand their services in one integrated place.', 'HR & Recruitment', null, null, 'Seed', 'Riyadh', 'Marketplace', 'https://www.qissatech.com/', 'https://ecosystemsa.com/modules/startups/3426c12d-48ab-4056-a1f5-00aeb6fd7883', 'https://ecosystemsa.com/modules/startups/3426c12d-48ab-4056-a1f5-00aeb6fd7883', null),
('ST_648', 'Rojeh Video Games', 'Rojeh Video Games is a game studio creating creative puzzle, cozy, and stylized games with a focus on charming worlds, unique gameplay ideas, and handcrafted art.', 'Gaming', 'B2C; B2B2C', null, 'Seed', 'Riyadh', 'Game Studio', 'https://www.rojehgames.com/', 'https://ecosystemsa.com/modules/startups/7653efa4-4801-4a3d-a86f-681b7d8627fe', 'https://ecosystemsa.com/modules/startups/7653efa4-4801-4a3d-a86f-681b7d8627fe', 'Saudi Arabia'),
('ST_649', 'Zest Equity', 'Zest is a digital transactional infrastructure company powering private-market transaction execution. Its all-in-one platform replaces fragmented processes with institutional-grade infrastructure across the deal lifecycle - managing investor onboarding, deal setup, reporting, and governance in one digitised workflow. The company offers regulated Escrow and Arranging services under Abu Dhabi Global Market FSRA''s regulatory framework, along with a layer of digital execution capabilities for SPV formation and deal workflow management that simplify, safeguard, and scale private-market transactions. Zest''s infrastructure brings all participants into a single, transparent, and repeatable workflow that unifies governance, documentation, and funding flows, enabling capital to move seamlessly and with confidence across jurisdictions. The company has supported over USD250+ million across 207 transactions spanning private equity, private credit, and venture capital.', 'Financial Services & Fintech; Technology', null, null, 'Pre-Series A', 'Riyadh', 'SPVs, Escrow, Arranging, Deal, Private Markets, infrastructure', 'https://www.zestequity.com/', 'https://ecosystemsa.com/modules/startups/42a03008-9c6b-44f3-babc-9791a2ed714a', 'https://ecosystemsa.com/modules/startups/42a03008-9c6b-44f3-babc-9791a2ed714a', null),
('ST_650', 'Waddah AI', 'A Saudi platform supported by synthetic intelligence, aimed at enabling lawyers and legal teams to analyse contracts, draft memorandums and suits with high precision, provides a smart search engine covering more than 450 Saudi regulations and regulations, reducing search hours and manual work to a few seconds. A number of advanced services are provided, which helps to increase the efficiency of the teams by up to 70% and with access to 99%.', 'AI & Deep Tech', null, null, 'Pre-Series A', 'Riyadh', 'AI, LegalTech', 'https://waddah.ai', 'https://ecosystemsa.com/modules/startups/8d6e0c3c-3ff0-4410-bee2-0617b7a308a9', 'https://ecosystemsa.com/modules/startups/8d6e0c3c-3ff0-4410-bee2-0617b7a308a9', null),
('ST_651', 'Bus14', 'Bus14 is a school transportation platform that provide safe, convenient & affordable school trips for students', 'Transportation & Logistics; Education, Research & Talent; Travel, Tourism & Hospitality', null, null, 'Pre-Seed', 'Riyadh', 'Marketplace, School transportation', 'https://www.bus14.co/', 'https://ecosystemsa.com/modules/startups/6a0bd1c5-c340-4de2-976a-1a4855468755', 'https://ecosystemsa.com/modules/startups/6a0bd1c5-c340-4de2-976a-1a4855468755', null),
('ST_652', 'SEED Innovation', 'a Saudi-based sports technology company headquartered in Jeddah. SEED''s core offering is an integrated platform for padel and tennis facility management combining smart court booking, 4K AI-powered video recording and performance analytics, payment processing , and player engagement tools — accessible via app, website, and WhatsApp AI. The platform targets both B2B (facility owners and sports organizations) and end users (players).', 'Sports & Entertainment', null, null, 'Seed', 'Makkah', 'Marketplace, SportTech, Booking', 'https://seedco.sa/en', 'https://ecosystemsa.com/modules/startups/fc10e8fa-05e1-47d0-aa5d-fef8effd9cc2', 'https://ecosystemsa.com/modules/startups/fc10e8fa-05e1-47d0-aa5d-fef8effd9cc2', null),
('ST_653', 'Synclane', 'Synclane is an IT Consulting firm based in Saudi Arabia. Our flagship platform, Tijori, is a modern, cloud-native Treasury Management System (TMS) that gives finance teams real-time visibility and control over cash, bank facilities, investments, and risk without the cost or complexity of legacy systems or heavy ERP integrations.
Purpose-built for the realities of regional treasury operations, Tijori unifies the workflows that matter most to today''s CFOs: Cash & Liquidity Management
Bank Facilities, Loans & Borrowings
Investments & Derivatives
Trade Finance & Supply Chain Finance
Payments, Reconciliation & Bank Connectivity
Automated Treasury Accounting
Risk & Compliance Monitoring (SAMA & ZATCA-aligned) From mid-sized enterprises to large corporates, Tijori helps finance leaders centralize treasury operations, accelerate decision-making, and unlock working capital. Cloud-native, secure, and scalable with automation and AI built in Tijori turns finance from reactive to proactive. Synclane isn''t just another fintech. We''re your strategic partner in transforming the Office of the CFO across the Kingdom and beyond.
🌐 Seamless Treasury. Simplified Accounting.', 'Technology', null, null, 'Series A', 'Riyadh', 'Fintech, Treasury', 'https://synclane.io', 'https://ecosystemsa.com/modules/startups/f86d579f-2bc5-46f0-882d-fc158a7d826f', 'https://ecosystemsa.com/modules/startups/f86d579f-2bc5-46f0-882d-fc158a7d826f', null),
('ST_654', 'Mrsam', 'Mrsam is an AI-powered Business Operating System that helps businesses build, launch, and grow digitally without needing technical expertise. From websites and landing pages to automation, customer engagement, and business operations, Mrsam transforms ideas into fully working digital businesses using AI.', 'Technology', null, null, 'Pre-Seed', 'Makkah', 'AI, SaaS, Website Generation', 'https://mrsam.io', 'https://ecosystemsa.com/modules/startups/d2ad9d37-a60f-46f1-9bad-937cc8b66400', 'https://ecosystemsa.com/modules/startups/d2ad9d37-a60f-46f1-9bad-937cc8b66400', null),
('ST_655', 'Mujtamaat', 'Mujtamaat is a Saudi PropTech company building a unified digital ecosystem for Owners Associations. The platform extends REGA''s Mullak program into the operational layer, bringing governance, finance, maintenance, and community into one place. One platform for Leaders, Managers, Owners, and Tenants. Vibrant living, by design.', 'Real Estate', null, null, 'Pre-Seed', 'Riyadh', 'PropTech, Real Estate, Community Management', 'https://www.mujtamaat.sa/', 'https://ecosystemsa.com/modules/startups/7ed673c8-6f4b-4a0a-97be-7af961499937', 'https://ecosystemsa.com/modules/startups/7ed673c8-6f4b-4a0a-97be-7af961499937', null),
