('ST_657', 'Skakir', 'Skakir is a simple and friendly loyalty program for E-commerce that lets your store’s customers collect points, have fun, and win rewards while shopping. Instead of buying once and leaving, Skakir encourages customers to come back again and again. Motivate new customers and reward your existing ones with fun features like cashback, stamp systems, and scratch & win, making every purchase a memorable experience. With Skakir… engagement increases, repeat visits grow, and sales start moving.', 'Technology; Retail & E-commerce; Consumer Services', null, null, 'Pre-Seed', 'Riyadh', 'Loyalty, SaaS', 'https://www.skakir.com/', 'https://ecosystemsa.com/modules/startups/1f46d46b-2d63-46b2-a12a-0a88b0ec7997', 'https://ecosystemsa.com/modules/startups/1f46d46b-2d63-46b2-a12a-0a88b0ec7997', null),
