('ST_662', 'ZORY AI', 'ZORY AI is a B2B2C AI-powered interior visualization and commerce platform serving the home furnishing, furniture retail, home décor, real estate, and PropTech industries. The platform helps homeowners, interior designers, furniture retailers, and real estate developers transform photos, sketches, floor plans, and ideas into realistic room designs and visual experiences. Unlike traditional AI design tools that stop at visualization, ZORY connects design intent with product discovery, shopping, and customer engagement. Users can redesign spaces, explore furnishing concepts, discover matching furniture and décor, and make more confident purchasing decisions through a seamless AI-powered experience. For furniture retailers and home décor brands, ZORY improves product discovery, customer engagement, and conversion by enabling customers to visualize products within realistic spaces. For real estate developers, ZORY enhances property visualization, buyer engagement, handover experiences, and furnishing programs through interactive digital experiences. By combining artificial intelligence, interior design, visual commerce, and real-world product ecosystems, ZORY bridges the gap between inspiration, visualization, and action, helping users turn ideas into beautifully designed and functional spaces.', 'Real Estate', 'B2B; B2C; B2B2C', null, 'Pre-Seed', 'Riyadh', 'AI, Interior Design, Subscription, B2C', 'https://zory.ai/', 'https://ecosystemsa.com/modules/startups/05c9de92-e302-4371-b196-065f2694e182', 'https://ecosystemsa.com/modules/startups/05c9de92-e302-4371-b196-065f2694e182', 'Saudi Arabia'),
('ST_663', 'Re new bank', 'Our ambition is to build a Digital Energy Bank, where energy becomes a tradable investment asset. To achieve this vision, we will progress through three strategic phases: Phase One:
Aggregating the energy market into a single digital platform by connecting customers with energy service providers. This phase has already been successfully implemented through the Re-New Bank platform, which enables customers to receive multiple offers within minutes, compare them, and select the most suitable solution with ease and full transparency. Phase Two:
Building an integrated ecosystem that brings together investors and customers within a unified digital environment, enabling the direct financing of energy projects and unlocking new investment opportunities driven by real demand. Phase Three:
Integrating government entities and large institutions to introduce renewable energy projects, where specialized companies submit their proposals, and these opportunities are presented to investors for participation—ultimately leading to the creation of a fully integrated energy market.', null, null, null, 'Seed', 'Eastern', 'Marketplace, Energy Tech, AI, B2B, B2C', 'https://re-newbank.com', 'https://ecosystemsa.com/modules/startups/1921518c-5d93-45cf-91e8-81ce4a7557d2', 'https://ecosystemsa.com/modules/startups/1921518c-5d93-45cf-91e8-81ce4a7557d2', null),
