('ST_674', '4th Layer', '4th Layer is a leading provider of advanced manufacturing solutions, specializing in Mechanical 3D Design, the development of Innovative Customized Automation Solutions, and the production of high-quality Customized Spare Parts. We leverage cutting-edge technologies of 3D printing to deliver exceptional results. By combining expert engineering with a commitment to innovation and customer satisfaction, 4th Layer empowers clients to increase productivity, improve product quality, and reduce costs. We strive to exceed expectations by providing tailored solutions that address unique challenges and drive operational excellence for our clients.', 'Energy & Sustainability; Professional Services; Manufacturing; Transportation & Logistics', 'B2B', 'Customized Spare Parts Manufacturing; Mechanical 3D Design; Innovative Customized Automation Solutions', 'Pre-Seed', 'MENA', 'Consulting and Advisory; Energy, Utilities & Natural Resources; Technology, Software and IT Services', 'https://www.4th-layer.com', null, 'https://www.4th-layer.com', 'Saudi Arabia'),
('ST_675', '7amdaan.io', '7amdaan.io is building the next generation of engagement and out-of-home advertising through autonomous, AI-powered robots.
Designed for malls, airports, exhibitions, schools, universities, educational institutions, retail destinations and smart cities, our robots move through high-footfall environments to deliver interactive, gamified and conversational experiences.
Beyond advertising, the platform can support education, campus communication, visitor guidance, announcements, surveys and institutional campaigns. Each experience can combine digital content, voice interaction, quizzes, QR engagement and real-time audience analytics.
Our privacy-first technology generates actionable insights without storing personal images or videos. By transforming conventional screens and information points into mobile, intelligent and measurable experiences, 7amdaan.io helps brands and institutions engage people in a more memorable way.
We are seeking investors, strategic partners, educational institutions, government entities, media operators, venue owners and brands to scale our robotic engagement platform across Saudi Arabia and the wider MENA region.', 'Creative Industries & Media; Sports & Entertainment', 'B2B; B2B2C', null, 'Pre-Seed', 'Africa; Asia; MENA; North America; Middle East', 'Technology, Software and IT Services', 'https://7amdaan.io', null, 'https://7amdaan.io', 'Bahrain'),
