('ST_679', 'Adadk', 'ADADK is pioneering an AI-driven early-warning platform that detects water leaks and contamination before structural or environmental damage occurs. By transforming complex data streams into actionable insights through centralized real-time IoT and dashboards, our technology empowers cities, smart buildings, agricultural enterprises, marine ecosystems, and desalination plants to safeguard scarce water, optimize energy consumption, and eliminate waste. ADADK delivers a scalable, mission-critical solution that drives measurable ESG transformation while protecting our planet’s most vital resource on a global scale. 💧🌍', 'Energy & Sustainability', 'B2B; B2G', null, 'Seed', 'Africa; Europe; Middle East', 'Energy, Utilities & Natural Resources', 'https://www.adadk.tech/Product3', null, 'https://www.adadk.tech/Product3', 'Saudi Arabia'),
('ST_680', 'Adalah Chain', 'AOF (Adalah Operating Framework) is a universal programmable governance framework that turns policy-compliant actions into mathematically verifiable evidence. It works across sectors , including banks, regulators, SMEs, and Halal assurance use cases
We’re also integrating Sakan WaqfX, a programmable home equity platform, currently at REGA sandbox, that unlocks trapped wealth in Saudi homes without selling or refinancing. Homeowners tokenize future earnings, investors access real estate with low entry (SAR 1.5K–2.5K), and a portion flows into a perpetual waqf for affordable housing.', 'Financial Services & Fintech', 'B2B; B2G', null, 'Pre-Seed', 'Asia; Europe; MENA; UK and Ireland', 'Financial Services and Banking; Real estate', 'https://adalahchain.com', null, 'https://adalahchain.com', 'Saudi Arabia'),
('ST_681', 'Adam Health', 'HIMS & HERS of the MENA region
Adam Health is Saudi Arabia’s first digital health hub built exclusively for men, making healthcare more accessible, discreet, and proactive, especially for issues men often delay or struggle to address openly.
We bring the healthcare journey into one Arabic-first platform, starting with tele-consultations for sensitive conditions such as sexual health with discreet medication delivery when prescribed, preventive lab testing and personalized health reports, and AI-powered primary care. AI is at the core of the platform. By connecting health history, lab results, consultations, medications, and wearable data, we’re building an intelligent care layer designed to understand each patient over time, provide personalized guidance, and help men take action earlier, while keeping physicians at the core of clinical care.
We’re currently raising our pre-seed round and looking to connect with investors and strategic partners at . Come say hello at Pod H1A.P281.', 'Health & Life Sciences', 'B2C; B2B2C', 'Adam Tele-Consultations; Adam Preventive Health; Adam AI Primary Care', 'Pre-Seed', 'MENA', 'Healthcare, Pharma and Life Sciences', 'https://www.foradam.health', null, 'https://www.foradam.health', 'Saudi Arabia'),
