('ST_687', 'Ai Geo Navigators', 'AI Geo Navigators is a climate-intelligence and geospatial firm specializing in converting climate and environmental data into actionable insights by integrating Artificial Intelligence (machine and deep learning) into GIS, remote sensing and traditional data analytics. We work on climate adaptation/mitigation, disaster risk reduction, early warning systems, ESG reporting, sustainability analytics, and PR & advocacy for environmental communication. Our projects extend beyond Pakistan including collaborations with leading universities and experts. We also train the next generation of ESG, climate, and AI-focused professionals.', null, 'B2B2C', 'Climate Risk and Resilience Intelligence; GeoAI and Decision-Support Systems; Environmental Management and Sustainability Solutions', 'No Funding Yet/Bootstrapped; Pre-Seed; Seed', 'Africa; Asia; Europe; MENA; Middle East', 'Agriculture and Food; Technology, Software and IT Services', 'https://aigeo360.com/', null, 'https://aigeo360.com/', 'Pakistan'),
('ST_688', 'Aikido Security', 'Aikido Security is building self-securing software for modern development teams. Aikido''s unified security platform secures code, cloud and runtime, helping teams to reduce risk without slowing down development. Aikido is the fastest-ever European cybersecurity company to reach unicorn status and is trusted by over 100,000 teams, with a global customer base including the Premier League, Revolut, SoundCloud, and Niantic.
Its latest release, AI Pentesting, brings AI to offensive security - running continuous, broad-coverage pen tests at a speed and scale manual testing can''t match.', null, 'B2B', null, 'Series B', 'Africa; Asia; Europe; LATAM; MENA; North America; Oceania; South America; UK and Ireland; Middle East', null, 'https://www.aikido.dev', null, 'https://www.aikido.dev', null),
