('ST_690', 'AIM Digital Company', null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null),
('ST_691', 'AiPathos', '**Aipathos** is a Saudi AI technology company focused on building practical AI solutions that transform how businesses operate and interact with their customers.
Our flagship product, **FlyThru**, is an AI-powered ordering platform for the F&B industry that enables customers to place orders through natural voice conversations and digital ordering experiences. FlyThru integrates with restaurant POS and payment systems, helping businesses increase efficiency, reduce operational pressure, and improve the customer experience. In less than two months, FlyThru has processed **40,000+ orders** and is already working with multiple restaurant and café brands across Saudi Arabia.
Beyond F&B, Aipathos is developing AI-driven enterprise solutions for other industries, including legal technology, with the broader goal of becoming a leading Saudi company in applied artificial intelligence.', null, null, 'Flythru', null, null, 'Technology, Software and IT Services', 'https://aipathos.com', null, 'https://aipathos.com', 'Saudi Arabia'),
('ST_692', 'AiTech – USA', 'AiTech-USA is a U.S.-based technology company developing AI-powered wearable health and intelligent digital platforms built on patented biosensing and artificial intelligence technologies. The company focuses on transforming physiological signals, contextual data, and user information into personalized, actionable insights through advanced sensing, proprietary algorithms, and AI.
AiTech-USA’s flagship platforms include Smart GlucoRing, Smart VitaRing, and Smart MakkaRing, each designed to address distinct aspects of health, wellness, and intelligent personal assistance.
Smart GlucoRing is an AI-powered, non-invasive glucose monitoring platform designed to estimate blood glucose levels without blood sampling and without disposable testing supplies. By combining proprietary AI algorithms with advanced intelligent sensors, Smart GlucoRing is designed to provide convenient and personalized glucose monitoring while reducing reliance on conventional blood-based glucose testing.
Smart VitaRing is an AI-powered comprehensive health and wellness platform that combines patented wearable sensing technology with advanced AI to monitor key physiological parameters, including blood pressure, respiratory rate, heart rate, heart rate variability (HRV), SpO₂, skin temperature, sleep, stress, and physical activity. The platform processes these signals to generate personalized health insights, identify trends, and provide intelligent recommendations to support users in managing their overall health and wellness.
Smart MakkaRing is an AI-powered Hajj and Umrah platform designed specifically to support pilgrims throughout their journey. The platform combines AI, intelligent wearable technologies, location-based services, and personalized digital assistance to provide pilgrims with an integrated solution covering health, location, safety, and religious guidance.
A key feature of Smart MakkaRing is its ability to extend the pilgrimage experience beyond the individual pilgrim by providing connected services for families. Through the platform, family members can potentially stay informed about a pilgrim’s location, wellbeing, and journey status, helping provide greater peace of mind while the pilgrim is performing Hajj or Umrah.
Through its patented technologies, AI-powered platforms, advanced wearable biosensing, and intelligent digital services, AiTech-USA is working to create a new generation of personalized health and human-centered AI platforms. From glucose monitoring and comprehensive wellness through Smart GlucoRing and Smart VitaRing to AI-powered pilgrimage support through Smart MakkaRing, AiTech-USA aims to transform wearable and digital technologies into intelligent platforms that deliver continuous, personalized, and actionable information for individuals and their families.', 'Health & Life Sciences', 'B2B2C', 'Smart VitaRing Wearable Health Platform; Smart GlucoRing; Smart MakkaRing Platform', 'Series A', null, 'Healthcare, Pharma and Life Sciences', 'https://www.aitech-usa.com', null, 'https://www.aitech-usa.com', 'United States'),
