('ST_714', 'Arbling Technologies FZ- LLC', 'Shoppers and AI agents are already choosing what to buy through ChatGPT and other AI platforms, but most online stores cannot see who arrived or which sales came from them. Arbling shows whether it was a person sent by AI, a shopping agent or a bot reading the store, then follows what products they touched and whether they bought. Unlike AI visibility tools that only count mentions and rankings, Arbling helps retailers fix what blocks the sale and capture this new agentic-commerce revenue before it goes to a competitor.', 'AI & Deep Tech', 'B2B; B2B2C', null, 'Pre-Seed; Seed', 'Asia; MENA; North America', 'Technology, Software and IT Services', 'https://arbling.com', null, 'https://arbling.com', 'Canada'),
