('ST_754', 'Carevision AI', 'Carevision is an award-winning AI-powered B2B platform that turns a 60-second facial scan into actionable health intelligence through our proprietary AI model. In seconds, Carevision detects digital biomarkers and subtle health signals associated with 14 cardiometabolic diseases, instantly classifies health risks, and delivers real-time insights to healthcare providers through seamless integration with health information systems. Through APIs, Carevision integrates into partners’ mobile apps, kiosks, digital clinics, and teleconsultation platforms—making intelligent screening accessible wherever people receive care. We make health screening radically simpler, faster, and more scalable by replacing complex, hardware-heavy processes with one intelligent experience. Carevision enables hospitals, insurers, pharmacies, and governments to identify cardiovascular and metabolic health risks earlier and deliver population screening at scale—all with a fraction of the traditional cost and infrastructure. With 12 million records powering our AI and 97% accuracy in cardiac prediction, Carevision is redefining preventive healthcare by transforming screening from a complex clinical process into an intelligent, scalable digital experience.', null, 'B2B', null, 'Seed', 'MENA', 'Healthcare, Pharma and Life Sciences', 'https://carevisionai.com/', null, 'https://carevisionai.com/', 'Saudi Arabia'),
