('ST_770', 'Creative AI', 'Creative AI develops Arabic first AI solutions for customer service departments. Its products help organizations automate customer interactions, evaluate customer-service conversations, monitor quality, and improve agent performance across voice and chat channels. The company supports cloud and on-premise deployment for enterprises and government organizations.', null, 'B2B; B2G', 'Evalia – AI Conversation Quality Platform; Kayan – Arabic AI Voice and Chat Agent; Daleel Mentor – AI Training and Coaching Platform; Custom AI Solution Development; Conversational AI & Virtual Agents; Arabic Speech Technology; AI Integration & Process Automation; Private AI Deployment & Enterprise Implementation', 'No Funding Yet/Bootstrapped; Pre-Seed', 'Africa; Europe; MENA; North America; Middle East', 'Technology, Software and IT Services', 'https://www.crtvai.com', null, 'https://www.crtvai.com', 'Jordan'),
('ST_771', 'Ctruh', 'Ctruh is building the infrastructure layer of the spatial internet.
Immersive experiences today remain locked behind native apps, heavy SDKs, headsets, and specialist studios, which is why the overwhelming majority of enterprises still communicate their products, spaces, and processes through flat images and PDFs. Ctruh removes every one of those barriers by making high-fidelity 3D, AI, and XR run natively in the browser, on any device, with zero downloads.
Verse Engine is our patented browser-native rendering engine, built on WebGL and WebGPU. It delivers real-time, high-fidelity 3D on standard consumer hardware, a phone, a laptop, a kiosk, without an app store, a plugin, or a headset. It is the foundation everything else at Ctruh sits on, and it is what makes an immersive experience as easy to distribute as a URL. For enterprises, this collapses the single largest barrier to adoption: distribution. A customer does not install anything, and a sales team does not ask them to.
VersaAI is our generative and on-device AI layer, converting text, images, and video into production-ready 3D assets. What has historically required a 3D artist and weeks of modelling time becomes a generated asset in minutes, at a fraction of the cost. VersaAI is what makes immersive content economically viable at enterprise scale rather than a one-off marketing expense, it turns 3D from a bespoke commission into a repeatable pipeline.
Together, these two layers form a complete stack: generate the asset, render it anywhere, and let anyone build with it.
Industries we serve
Ctruh is horizontal infrastructure, and our deployments span:
Real estate and construction: virtual walkthroughs, pre-construction visualisation, digital sales galleries for developers and giga-projectsRetail and e-commerce: 3D product configurators, virtual storefronts, try-before-you-buy experiencesAutomotive: online configurators, virtual showrooms, dealer and aftersales visualisationManufacturing and industrial: digital twins, plant and equipment visualisation, remote inspectionEnergy and heavy industry: asset visualisation, operational training, safety simulationEducation and training: immersive learning modules, procedural and skills training at scaleTravel, hospitality and tourism:property and destination previews, heritage and cultural experiencesCredentials
Founded in 2023 and headquartered in Bengaluru, India, Ctruh holds three patents in core XR technology and is backed by a seed round led by Inflection Point Ventures , Avinya Ventures and India Accelerator co-leading. Our team of 50 spans engineering, AI/ML, 3D design, and go-to-market. Ctruh featured on Shark Tank India Season 5, and we are currently raising a Series A to scale international deployment.
Why now, and why Saudi Arabia
Vision 2030 has made the Kingdom one of the fastest technology-adopting markets in the world, with giga-projects, retail, and industrial sectors all actively investing in immersive and digital-twin capability. Our engagement with Saudi Aramco confirmed both the appetite and the fit. is our formal entry point into the region, and the infrastructure layer we have built is precisely what a market building entire cities from scratch needs to visualise, sell, and operate them.', null, 'B2B; B2B2C', null, 'Seed', 'MENA; North America', 'Technology, Software and IT Services', 'https://www.ctruh.com/', null, 'https://www.ctruh.com/', 'India'),
