('ST_777', 'Dapti LLC', 'Dapti is an AI-powered learning platform built to make learning more effective, personalized, and engaging.
Our core philosophy is "learn by doing". Instead of passively consuming lessons, students learn through continuous practice, feedback, correction, and progression.
Dapti understands what each student knows, where they struggle, and what they should learn next. It adapts the learning journey around their skills and progress, while gamification and engaging experiences motivate them to keep moving forward.
For teachers and schools, dapti.school helps manage classrooms, plan learning, and continuously collect meaningful student data. It turns this data into role-specific insights and reports for teachers, academic directors, and school directors, giving each level the information it needs to make better decisions.
