('ST_784', 'DIGISEC', 'DIGISEC – Strengthening Human Cyber Defense
DIGISEC is a specialized cybersecurity awareness and Human Risk Management (HRM) company headquartered in Riyadh, Saudi Arabia. DIGISEC helps organizations measure, manage, and reduce human cyber risk through advanced awareness programs, phishing simulations, behavioral analytics, and executive cybersecurity training.
Through its Human Risk Management approach, DIGISEC enables organizations to understand employee cyber behavior, identify risk exposure, and implement targeted interventions that improve security practices across the workforce. Our services are designed to strengthen the human layer of cybersecurity, build a resilient security culture, and support organizations in meeting regulatory and compliance requirements.
DIGISEC also designs and develops custom cybersecurity awareness content, including videos, interactive campaigns, internal communication materials, and SCORM-compliant eLearning courses compatible with enterprise Learning Management Systems (LMS). In addition, DIGISEC organizes cybersecurity awareness events, workshops, and engagement activities that help organizations promote a strong security culture and actively involve employees in protecting the organization from cyber threats.
By combining Human Risk Management practices, behavioral insights, and engaging learning experiences, DIGISEC helps organizations sustainably reduce human cyber risk and enhance overall cyber resilience.
Learn more at: digisec.com.sa', 'Cybersecurity; Aerospace & Defense; Education, Research & Talent', 'B2B; B2G', 'Cybersecurity Awareness & Behavior Change Programs; Phishing Simulation & Human Risk Testing; Cybersecurity Awareness Content Development; Executive Cybersecurity Training', 'Seed', 'MENA', 'Education, Academia and Research; Technology, Software and IT Services', 'https://digisec.com.sa', null, 'https://digisec.com.sa', 'Saudi Arabia'),
