('ST_791', 'Dovera.ai', 'Dovera.ai — the AI-native Customer Experience platform.
Dovera unifies sales, support, and marketing in one intelligent workspace — where AI agents work autonomously in your customers'' own language and dialect, 24/7. Already processing 5M+ interactions across 5 countries for businesses in healthcare, real estate, fitness, e-commerce, and retail.
Every conversation — WhatsApp, Instagram, Messenger, Web chat, Telegram, and TikTok — lands in a single unified inbox. AI agents reply, qualify, book, and resolve; and because a deterministic router makes every assignment, teams keep full visibility and control — the AI suggests, the router decides. No black box
What sets Dovera apart:
Deep multilingual and dialect-aware — understands English and real Arabic dialects (Gulf, Egyptian, Levantine, Maghrebi), not machine translation — with more languages ready on request.Official Meta Tech Provider with Zero-Ban™ protection — connect your existing WhatsApp number safely, without the ban risk that shuts most businesses down.A CRM that builds itself — describe your business in plain Arabic, and Dovera generates your pipeline, stages, and fields; then fills them automatically from every conversation.
The platform includes:
Unified Omnichannel Inbox — every conversation, every channel, one place — with a unified profile per customer.No-code AI Agents — qualify leads, book appointments, resolve tickets, and run campaigns 24/7.Conversation-native CRM — records that write themselves from live interactions, customizable to any industry.Sales Pipeline — visual deal management with AI scoring and forecasting.Help Desk & Tickets — full ticketing with SLA management.Marketing Campaigns — WhatsApp broadcasts, sequences, and automated follow-ups.Appointments & Booking — complete calendar with reminders and no-show prediction.Supervisor Dashboard & Analytics — real-time operations and agent-performance monitoring.
One intelligent workspace — replacing a stack of disconnected tools.
Backed by Google Cloud for Startups, Microsoft for Startups, NVIDIA Inception, AWS Startups, and TIEC by ITIDA.', 'AI & Deep Tech', 'B2B', 'Dovera Platform; Unified Omnichannel Inbox; DO Agents (no-code); Conversation-native CRM; Onboarding & Setup; AI Agent Design & Training; Custom API Integrations; Ongoing Support & Optimization', 'Seed', 'Africa; Asia; MENA', 'Technology, Software and IT Services', 'https://www.dovera.ai', null, 'https://www.dovera.ai', 'Egypt'),
