('ST_795', 'DuoKey SA', 'DuoKey helps financial institutions and regulated enterprises migrate to post-quantum cryptography. Its PQC Scanner discovers cryptographic assets agentlessly TLS endpoints, certificates, keystores, source code, cloud KMS and HSMs and produces a Cryptographic Bill of Materials (CBOM) plus a 0–100 Quantum Readiness Score built for board reporting. Where the rest of the market stops at a ticket, DuoKey closes the loop: AI agents draft, verify and deploy PQC and hybrid changes to production infrastructure (F5, Fortinet, PKI, cloud KMS), with human approval and documented rollback. Swiss-engineered, ISO/IEC 27001 certified, MPC-based key management, native ServiceNow integration.', null, 'B2B', null, 'Series A', 'Africa; Asia; Europe; MENA; Middle East', 'Technology, Software and IT Services', 'Https://duokey.com', null, 'Https://duokey.com', 'Switzerland'),
