('ST_859', 'Humentra.ai', 'Humentra is the AI-native intelligence layer for the workforce you already have.
Humentra sits on top of the HCM systems you already run, reads the data you already have, and turns it into decisions across hiring, skills, pay benchmarking, succession and internal mobility. An agentic AI framework does the work specialized agents read every profile in parallel and surface recommendations; your people make the decisions. 14 modules across four stages - Hire · Lead & Perform · Develop & Grow · Operate & Retain — all on one intelligence layer. Adopt one module, one stage, or the whole platform.
Built for how regulated, public-sector and sovereign buyers actually procure: data residency (EU / US / UK and in-region), AI governance documented to EU AI Act Annex IV, and human oversight by design. The platform is live and in-market with 2,000+ users and delivery on sovereign-adjacent and public-sector mandates in the UAE - now expanding across the GCC as the region builds toward Vision 2030 and the Year of AI.
We win the mid-market that enterprise-only platforms overshoot teams that need answers now, configured to how they already work, on a $47B talent-intelligence opportunity.
→ HR & talent leaders: tell us what your HR system doesn''t do - we''ll show you the part that applies.
→ Investors & partners: we''re building the talent-intelligence layer, expanding alongside the incumbents rather than against them.
