('ST_988', 'Phaseshift', 'At Phaseshift, we create and build a new kind of super-thin material called an optical metasurface. This special material will change what is possible in fields like quantum computing and advanced sensing. Our goal is to make today''s large, room-sized equipment much smaller, better, and more efficient by fitting it all onto a single, tiny chip. Our unique metasurface technology gives us precise control over light, allowing us to build the small, strong, and scalable quantum devices of the future. Our technology is also useful for other areas, like powerful lasers and self-driving cars, where companies also want better performance in a smaller size.', null, 'B2B; B2G', null, 'Seed', 'North America', 'Other; Technology, Software and IT Services', 'https://phaseshift.tech', null, 'https://phaseshift.tech', 'United States'),
