('ST_990', 'PIXEL', 'PIXEL is a Riyadh-based startup building Smart Business Cards, the modern replacement for the paper business card.
Tap your Smart Business Card on any phone and your full contact details save instantly to that phone. No app, no typing, no paper to hand over. Your details stay updatable at any time, so a new job title or number never means a reprint. Everything you share is protected by our industry first security system, so your information does not stay exposed online.
Built and operated in Saudi Arabia, PIXEL supports the digital transformation goals of Vision 2030 by replacing a daily paper habit with a smarter, more sustainable way for businesses to connect.
We offer the Original and Metal Edition cards for individuals, and fully customised cards with a shared dashboard for teams and companies.', 'Consumer Services', 'B2B; B2C; B2G', null, 'Seed', 'MENA', 'Technology, Software and IT Services', 'https://www.pixel-nfc.com', null, 'https://www.pixel-nfc.com', 'Saudi Arabia'),
('ST_991', 'PixelLand', 'PixelLand is a Riyadh-based EdTech and extended reality (XR) studio dedicated to transforming how students engage with science and mathematics through interactive 3D learning.
Traditional education often struggles to hold students'' attention when explaining complex STEM concepts—from human anatomy and astronomy to mathematical measurement. PixelLand bridges this gap by turning abstract lessons into tangible digital adventures. Our flagship mobile platform, PixelLand AR, replaces static materials with a dynamic library of augmented reality content bundles and interactive mini-games that bring curriculums to life.
What sets us apart is our deep technical foundation in game engine architecture and immersive design. By leveraging advanced XR technologies, we build highly engaging, visually rich educational modules that encourage active, hands-on participation. Recognized among the top 50 startups in the Misk Launchpad program, we are rapidly scaling our digital ecosystem to support learners, educators, and schools.
We are thrilled to be at ! Connect with us to:
Experience a live demo of the PixelLand AR platform.
Explore our interactive STEM modules, including our latest 3D educational games.
Discuss partnership and investment opportunities as we shape the future of immersive EdTech in Saudi Arabia and beyond.', 'Education, Research & Talent', 'B2B; B2C', 'PixelLand AR; Custom XR & Software Solutions', 'No Funding Yet/Bootstrapped; Pre-Seed', 'MENA; North America', 'Education, Academia and Research; Media, Entertainment and Gaming', 'https://pixelland.io', null, 'https://pixelland.io', 'Saudi Arabia'),
