('ST_1000', 'QuantiCor Security', 'QuantiCor — Quantum-Safe Cybersecurity
PQVault
PQVault is a quantum-safe data protection platform securing sensitive enterprise data, documents, devices, and collaboration workflows throughout their lifecycle. Its modular architecture provides encryption, access control, secure sharing, collaboration, signatures, approvals, and audit capabilities.
PQVault Files
Quantum-safe protection for sensitive documents and files with encryption, digital signatures, granular access controls, and revocable permissions. Keeps data protected and under control even after it has been shared.
PQVault Drive
Quantum-safe encryption for data stored on computers, removable media, and existing storage environments. Protects data transparently without requiring changes to established workflows.
PQVault Spaces
Quantum-safe collaboration spaces for documents, data, and connected machines, designed for Industry 4.0, engineering, supply chains, projects, and cross-company collaboration. It combines signatures, approvals, Q&A, membership, secure sharing, and complete audit trails in one controlled environment.
PQVault Store & Share
Securely store and share sensitive data with employees, customers, suppliers, and partners using quantum-safe protection and controlled access. Organizations maintain control over who can access information, for how long, and under which permissions.
PQVault Collaboration
Quantum-safe communication for secure chat, video, and file exchange. Enables teams and organizations to collaborate while keeping sensitive communications protected.
PQVault Sentinel
Automatically detects and classifies sensitive data and applies protection policies based on organizational rules. It reduces human error and helps ensure consistent protection of sensitive information.
PQVault Device Sync
Quantum-safe, direct device-to-device transfer of sensitive data without an app or intermediary server. It enables secure data exchange between trusted devices while keeping information under the organization’s control.
PQVault SDK
A quantum-safe security toolkit that enables developers to integrate data protection directly into applications and digital solutions. It allows organizations to build quantum-safe security into their own products, systems, and workflows.
PQCryptoGuard
PQCryptoGuard discovers and assesses cryptographic assets across the enterprise, identifying vulnerable algorithms, certificates, keys, applications, and protocols. It provides the visibility and risk assessment organizations need to plan and prioritize their transition to post-quantum cryptography.
PQInfraProtect
PQInfraProtect adds quantum-safe protection to existing IT and network infrastructure without requiring major changes to applications or architecture. It protects enterprise communications and data flows while enabling centralized cryptographic control and crypto-agility.', null, 'B2B', 'PQVault', null, 'Europe; North America; Middle East', null, 'https://quanticor-security.com', null, 'https://quanticor-security.com', 'Germany')
