('ST_1003', 'Rasheed', 'Innovative Digital Solutions is a Saudi retail technology company building Rasheed, an ecosystem that replaces paper receipts with a smart digital experience. Our flagship device, TapCeipt, delivers instant contactless receipts at checkout and keeps working even without an internet connection, with no POS integration required. Our consumer app turn every transaction into insight, offers, expense management and receipts pocket.', 'Consumer Services', 'B2C; B2G; B2B2C', null, 'Seed', 'Africa; Asia; Europe; MENA; North America; UK and Ireland; Middle East', 'Retail, E-commerce and Consumer Goods; Technology, Software and IT Services', 'https://rasheedapp.com', null, 'https://rasheedapp.com', 'Saudi Arabia'),
('ST_1004', 'REG-1', 'REG-1 — Compliance in One. REG-1 is an AI-native ecosystem that unifies Governance, Legal, Risk and Compliance into a single intelligent platform — giving every complex, multi-jurisdictional organisation one continuously assured source of truth. Entities, policies, obligations, risk and evidence share one governed data model, so every link is traceable and every change is audit-ready.
What sets REG-1 apart is the agentic layer that wraps the entire ecosystem. The equivalent of hundreds of specialised GLRC agents work your estate 24/7 — screening, scanning, attesting and triaging in parallel across every module — so assurance is live, not periodic. The result is up to 90% less manual policy effort, one real-time view of your compliance posture, and an engine that does the heavy lifting while your team reviews and decides.
The platform spans six GLRC domains under one licence — from regulatory intelligence and horizon scanning, policy and obligations, AI governance and enterprise risk, to data privacy, legal ops, client onboarding, AML and third-party risk — with screening across 240+ jurisdictions. Privacy and data governance is the natural entry point for most GCC organisations, but the same governed foundation extends natively into full enterprise GLRC. Modular by design: start with the modules you need today and switch on new capability without re-platforming, data migration or a second login.', null, 'B2B', 'Data Privacy / PDPL Toolkit; AI Governance Toolkit; NDI & NDMO Compliance Toolkit', 'Series A', 'Asia; MENA; North America; UK and Ireland; Middle East', 'Other; Technology, Software and IT Services', 'https://www.reg-1.com', null, 'https://www.reg-1.com', 'United Kingdom'),
