('ST_1006', 'Resemble AI, Inc.', 'Resemble AI''s deepfake detection models protect government organizations and enterprises against AI-driven impersonation, fraud and disinformation. Its detection technology identifies AI-generated audio, video and images in real time, and is deployable via cloud or on-premises to meet data sovereignty and national security requirements. The platform spans deepfake detection, identity verification, watermarking and fraud pattern intelligence. In an independent third-party benchmark, Resemble delivered 99.5% accuracy, ranking first among eight systems evaluated.', null, 'B2B', 'Resemble Detect', 'Series A', 'Asia; Europe; MENA; North America; South America; UK and Ireland; Middle East', 'Technology, Software and IT Services', 'https://www.resemble.ai/', null, 'https://www.resemble.ai/', 'United States'),
