('ST_1022', 'Sariat', 'Sariat is a licensed Saudi PropTech company building the path from renting to owning.
Saudi Arabia is moving toward 70% home ownership, but the first step is missing: the bank route demands a credit record and a large down payment, and annual-upfront rent makes both impossible to build. Rent buys a year of shelter and accumulates into nothing.
Rent to Own changes that. One contract, paid monthly, where every payment carries two parts one for the use of the property, one that accumulates as ownership. At the end of the term, title transfers. No mandatory down payment. Built on Ijarah. Residential and commercial.
We are live now with developer partners, and we are accepting units. For portfolio owners, we convert existing tenants into gradual owners.
Licensed by the Real Estate General Authority License No. 1200027786.', 'Consumer Services', 'B2B; B2C; B2B2C', 'Rent To Own', 'Seed', 'MENA; North America', 'Financial Services and Banking', 'https://sariat.sa', null, 'https://sariat.sa', 'Saudi Arabia'),
