('ST_1024', 'Scene', 'Scene is an AI-powered social platform for movie and TV lovers. Track every movie, episode, and show you watch, write reviews with photos or GIFs, discover recommendations tailored to your taste, and build a personalized profile that tells the story of your entertainment journey.', 'Creative Industries & Media; Sports & Entertainment', 'B2C', null, 'Pre-Seed', 'Asia; Europe; MENA; North America', 'Media, Entertainment and Gaming', 'https://scenesa.com', null, 'https://scenesa.com', 'Saudi Arabia'),
('ST_1025', 'Schoolz', 'Schoolz is a smart mobility and transportation technology company transforming school, university, and employee transportation across the MENA region. We combine managed transportation services with our proprietary Routz SaaS platform, enabling schools and fleet operators to manage buses, routes, drivers, students, safety, and daily operations through one integrated system.
Our technology provides real-time GPS tracking, live trip monitoring, safety alerts, driver behavior analytics, digital operations management, and AI-powered route optimization, helping transportation providers improve safety, efficiency, and service quality.
Schoolz has completed 4.5M+ trips, generated $3.1M+ in revenue, and reached 5,000+ average active subscriptions. We are expanding from Egypt into the GCC, with operations in Kuwait and a strong focus on scaling in Saudi Arabia and the wider MENA region.
Our vision is to build the technology infrastructure for safer, smarter, more efficient, and more sustainable mobility.', null, 'B2B; B2C; B2G', 'Routz; Schoolz', 'Seed', 'Africa; Asia; MENA; Middle East', 'Education, Academia and Research; Other; Technology, Software and IT Services', 'https://schoolz.io', null, 'https://schoolz.io', 'Saudi Arabia'),
