('ST_1027', 'Sehrish & Co. FZE LLC', 'Byondbites is an AI-powered food, nutrition, and wellness ecosystem designed to simplify how people cook, eat, and manage their health. The platform brings together ingredient and meal scanning, personalised recipes, nutrition tracking, AI-powered guidance through Ayra, customised meal and workout plans, and future access to nutrition professionals and grocery services. Byondbites connects everyday cooking with personalised health support in one practical platform.', null, 'B2B; B2C', 'Byondbites AI Kitchen Companion; Ayra AI Companion; Byondbites Health Mode; Health Mode; 1. AI-Powered Food Discovery; 2. Personalised Nutrition and Wellness Planning; Food-Tech Partnerships and Integrations', 'No Funding Yet/Bootstrapped', 'MENA', null, 'https://www.byondbites.com', null, 'https://www.byondbites.com', 'Saudi Arabia'),
('ST_1028', 'Semo App', 'Preparing for Qudurat and Tahsili can be overwhelming for many students, especially when they don’t have the right guidance along the way. Semo App was built to make this journey easier by giving every student a personalized learning experience, helping them practice effectively, track their progress, and prepare with confidence.', 'Education, Research & Talent', 'B2C; B2B2C', null, 'Pre-Seed', 'MENA', 'Education, Academia and Research', 'https://trymasar.co', null, 'https://trymasar.co', 'Saudi Arabia'),
