('ST_1076', 'Tech Era Company', 'About Tech Era
Tech Era is a robotics and industrial automation integrator transforming enterprise operations through intelligent, autonomous systems. We deliver turnkey robotic fleets, high-speed manipulation cells, and AI-driven automation engineered to maximize throughput, enhance workplace safety, and accelerate the transition to smart, digitized industrial ecosystems.
Autonomous Precision. Scalable Throughput. Next-Generation Robotics for Industry 4.0.
Core Solutions:
Intralogistics & Warehouse Fleet: Autonomous Mobile Robots (AMRs) and Automated Guided Vehicles (AGVs) for high-density storage, automated pallet handling, and seamless WMS/ERP integration.
Industrial Robotic Manipulators: High-speed Delta and articulated robotic arms for precision pick-and-place, packaging, sorting, and manufacturing assembly lines.
Commercial Autonomous Service Fleet: AI-powered floor scrubbers, sweepers, and delivery robots engineered for shopping malls, airports, and large-scale corporate campuses.
Specialized & Tactical Platforms: Robotic solar panel cleaning solutions, outdoor autonomous security patrol units, and inspection crawlers for critical infrastructure.
Value Proposition:
End-to-End Execution: Comprehensive site assessments, CAD simulation modeling, hardware integration, and localized field support.
Measurable ROI: 24/7 autonomous duty cycles designed to lower operating overhead, eliminate bottlenecks, and increase daily facility throughput.
Fleet Intelligence: Centralized dispatch software providing real-time spatial mapping, route optimization, and predictive maintenance.
Target Sectors
