('ST_1104', 'Virtuosis AI', 'Voice as a Biomarker of our Health
Virtuosis, an EPFL spin-off recognized as Microsoft Startup of the Year 2023, has developed clinically validated AI models that detect and monitor up to 25 health conditions including depression, Parkinson''s, Alzheimer’s, cardiometabolic and respiratory health from a simple 30-second voice recording. With over one million voice checks conducted through our partners’ digital health platforms and our web app, Virtuosis bridges cutting-edge science and scalable technology to make preventive health check-ups accessible worldwide.', null, 'B2B; B2C; B2G; B2B2C', null, 'Series A', 'Asia; Europe; MENA; North America', 'Healthcare, Pharma and Life Sciences; Technology, Software and IT Services', 'https://www.virtuosis.ai', null, 'https://www.virtuosis.ai', 'Switzerland'),
