('ST_1106', 'Voiset', 'Voiset — Your AI Day Planner. Get 2 hours back. Every day.
Voiset, built by Union Smart Tech s.r.o. (Slovakia), is an AI-powered voice task manager and day planner trusted by 6,000+ teams and professionals worldwide. Speak, and Voiset turns your words into scheduled tasks — our AI understands context, priorities, and deadlines, then automatically finds the optimal slot in your calendar.
