('ST_1113', 'Waspito', 'Waspito ("Health Without a Step") is a three-sided platform — patients, providers, payers — where an African health AI orchestrates care delivery and financing across Central and West Africa. It fixes healthcare at the point of payment: patients get care with zero out-of-pocket pre-financing, providers are paid instantly on claim validation, and payers gain real-time control over fraud and leakage. Sitting on the live transaction flow is AHIM, our African Health Intelligence Model — a clinical LLM fine-tuned on proprietary, closed-loop patient–provider–payer data that adjudicates medical necessity in eight seconds at $0.002, versus 45 minutes and $3.50 for a human reviewer. With ~1.1M patients, ~3,250 providers, and 300,000+ consultations, Waspito is live and revenue-generating in Cameroon and Côte d''Ivoire, with insurer partners including Be-Life and Activa. Because every new market feeds AHIM, Waspito is portable deep-tech health infrastructure — built to scale across Africa and into other emerging markets.', null, 'B2B; B2C; B2G; B2B2C', 'Instant Teleconsultation; Mobile laboratories and Pharmacies; AFRICAN INTELLIGENCE HEALTH MODEL - AHIM; Health Wallet; Teleconsultation', 'Series A', 'Africa', 'Healthcare, Pharma and Life Sciences', null, null, null, null),
